  "limits": [
    "No runtime activation, installed Preview/#47 change, old environment mutation, artifact deletion, game execution or new current authority is authorized by this source transfer.",
    "Keep the selected clean runtime and FEX tool checkouts, the ten exact assembly builder paths, the path-bound historical 494-byte frame request, original failure evidence, immutable generated/object/toolchain/SDK packs, candidates, private configuration and user state while required by any consumer.",
    "Source commit or byte equality does not authorize relocating a retained builder path. Different bindings require reviewed new assembly records and affected checks.",
    "Initial private evidence archive hashes metadata and copied evidence objects; it is not a full payload backup. External dependencies and explicitly retired/unavailable objects remain separately recorded.",
    "Actual input recovery covers exact binding metadata and one 3634-byte common header on the historical candidate2 scope. No full candidate3, object/toolchain, prefix, save, credential or private-state restore is claimed.",
    "Separate offline D24/D32/N1 and parked D37 research retain their existing owner and unfinished status. Only exact imported pieces are transferred.",
    "D36 Loading/owner_refused/ECGate observations remain unresolved; WGI remains a hypothesis. Gameplay, manual response timing, audio, Steamworks, full Rosetta independence, cold-prefix initialization and ordinary-user distribution remain unqualified.",
    "Future diagnostics require fresh exact-input, producer, space, authority, lease/deadline and independent resource-release checks. Saved acceptance, inspection or pass records are not live grants.",
    "Original copyright/license notices and per-path exceptions remain unchanged. Source ownership here means editing responsibility, not a transfer of copyright or a new license."
